[ext_resource type="ArrayMesh" uid="uid://b4gmg8dwxso1o" path="res://assets/fx/resources/0_standard_spike.tres" id="2_spike"]

; Design ruling 13: both terrain zones (the Maar's crater, the Grav-Amped field) draw this one
; scene, built from the same violet-grey palette as dep_maar.svg's glow - shattered rock shards
; drifting up off the broken ground rather than the haze Poisoned Soil uses, since this ground is
; cracked open rather than toxic. Structurally the Poisoned Soil shape (fxe_poisoned_soil.tscn):
; lock_height_to = 3 (SURFACE) so it sits on the ground rather than at the unit's centre, one
; GPUParticles3D, one ParticleProcessMaterial, low amount, long lifetime.
